     91  08a6							; one screen step per keyboard scan, 2 ms after it, on a pass of its
     92  08a6							; own (a scan and a screen step in one pass would stretch it)
     93  08a6							; (v0.12: the SID effects take a non-scan pass the screen doesn't need)
