    234  5dde							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    235  5dde							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    236  5dde							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  5dde							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  5dde							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  5dde							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    240  5dde							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    241  5dde							; press).
    242  5dde				   OkpPress
    243  5dde					      subroutine
